        <span class="marquee-item"><span class="marquee-dot"></span>Legacy Migration</span>
        <span class="marquee-item"><span class="marquee-dot"></span>Static Site Generation</span>
        <span class="marquee-item"><span class="marquee-dot"></span>Conversion Engineering</span>
        <span class="marquee-item"><span class="marquee-dot"></span>USA / Europe Markets</span>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ── ABOUT OVERVIEW ────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="overview-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-label">
            <div class="section-label-line"></div>
            <span>The Agency</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-grid-2">
            <div class="reveal">
                <h2 class="ov-subheading">
                    We don't write <em>code</em>.<br />We engineer <em>outcomes</em>.
                </h2>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p class="ov-text reveal">
                    Gilbert Specialists Tech is a boutique .NET &amp; Cloud engineering consultancy
                    based in Nairobi, Kenya - competing on expertise, not geography. We partner with high-growth companies and enterprise teams across the USA, United Kingdom, European Union, and global markets on a premium, remote contract basis.
                </p>
                <p class="ov-text reveal reveal-d1">
                 As a registered, technical consultancy, we operate with the structural transparency and strict cross-border compliance that international procurement requires. We are fully equipped for frictionless, compliant vendor onboarding - including IRS Form <strong>W-8BEN</strong> processing for US entities and international independent contractor frameworks that eliminate global labor misclassification risks. Every engagement is architected for seamless integration, elite technical execution, and measurable business impact.
                </p>
                <div class="ov-cta-row reveal reveal-d2">
                    <a href="/about" class="btn-secondary">
                        <span>Learn about us</span><span class="arrow-right">→</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ── SERVICES OVERVIEW ──────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="overview-section alt-bg">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-label">
            <div class="section-label-line"></div>
            <span>Capabilities</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-grid-2 mb-60">
            <div class="reveal">
                <h2 class="ov-heading">What<br />We Do.</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="reveal reveal-d1 self-end">
                <p class="ov-text">Specialized across the full .NET ecosystem and Microsoft cloud stack. No generalists. No handoffs.</p>
                <div class="ov-cta-row">
                    <a href="/services" class="btn-secondary">
                        <span>All capabilities</span><span class="arrow-right">→</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-grid-3">
            <div class="mini-card reveal">
                <span class="mc-num">01</span>
                <div class="mc-icon">◈</div>
                <div class="mc-title">Blazor WebAssembly Development</div>
                <div class="mc-text">End-to-end Blazor WASM with prerendering for instant load times. Performance, SEO, and conversion-first.</div>
                <a href="/services" class="mc-link">View details →</a>
            </div>
            <div class="mini-card reveal reveal-d1">
                <span class="mc-num">02</span>
                <div class="mc-icon">⬡</div>
                <div class="mc-title">Azure Cloud Architecture</div>
                <div class="mc-text">Cost-optimized, resilient cloud systems built for enterprise scale from Static Web Apps to microservices.</div>
                <a href="/services" class="mc-link">View details →</a>
            </div>
            <div class="mini-card reveal reveal-d2">
                <span class="mc-num">03</span>
                <div class="mc-icon">◎</div>
                <div class="mc-title">Legacy System Migration</div>
                <div class="mc-text">Safe, zero-downtime migrations from WPF, React, or legacy .NET to modern Blazor architectures.</div>
                <a href="/services" class="mc-link">View details →</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ── TAGLINE STRIP ──────────────────────────────────────── -->
<div class="tagline-strip">
    <div class="tagline-text">
        Web Apps That Convert.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Cloud Infrastructure That Delivers.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Specialized. Reliable. Profitable.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Engineering Your Next Level of Growth.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
        Web Apps That Convert.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Cloud Infrastructure That Delivers.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Specialized. Reliable. Profitable.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Engineering Your Next Level of Growth.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ── CASE STUDIES OVERVIEW ─────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="overview-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-label">
            <div class="section-label-line"></div>
            <span>Selected Work</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-grid-2 mb-60 align-end">
            <div class="reveal"><h2 class="ov-heading">Case<br />Studies.</h2></div>
            <div class="reveal reveal-d1">
                <a href="/work" class="btn-secondary">
                    <span>View all work</span><span class="arrow-right">→</span>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="case-preview">
            <div class="cp-item reveal">
                <div class="cp-tag">Government · Education</div>
                <div class="cp-num">01</div>
                <div class="cp-title">Transforming Legacy React Portals into Dynamic Blazor Solutions</div>
                <div class="cp-outcome">100<span>%</span></div>
                <div class="cp-outcome-label">Code maintenance eliminated · WCAG 2.0 compliant</div>
                <a href="/work" class="cp-more">Read case study</a>
            </div>
            <div class="cp-item reveal reveal-d1">
                <div class="cp-tag">PropTech · Netherlands</div>
                <div class="cp-num">02</div>
                <div class="cp-title">Reducing Check-In Times by 60% via Custom .NET Architecture</div>
                <div class="cp-outcome">60<span>%</span></div>
                <div class="cp-outcome-label">Faster check-in · Full digital documentation</div>
                <a href="/work" class="cp-more">Read case study</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ── PROCESS OVERVIEW ───────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="overview-section alt-bg">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-label">
            <div class="section-label-line"></div>
            <span>The Method</span>
        </div>
        <div class="ov-grid-2 mb-60">
            <div class="reveal"><h2 class="ov-heading">Our<br />Process.</h2></div>
            <div class="reveal reveal-d1 self-end">
                <p class="ov-text">Every engagement follows a proven architecture. No surprises. No scope creep.</p>
                <div class="ov-cta-row">
                    <a href="/process" class="btn-secondary">
                        <span>Full process</span><span class="arrow-right">→</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="pp-list reveal">
            <div class="pp-step">
                <div class="pp-num">01</div>
                <div class="pp-body"><h4>Discovery &amp; Problem Definition</h4><p>Business problem first. Audit, pain points, and measurable goals before any technology decisions.</p></div>
                <div class="pp-arrow">→</div>
            </div>
            <div class="pp-step">
                <div class="pp-num">02</div>
                <div class="pp-body"><h4>Architecture &amp; Design</h4><p>Software Design Document approved before a single line of code is written.</p></div>
                <div class="pp-arrow">→</div>
            </div>
            <div class="pp-step">
                <div class="pp-num">03</div>
                <div class="pp-body"><h4>Delivery in Milestones</h4><p>Four-week sprints with clear, production-deployable checkpoints.</p></div>
                <div class="pp-arrow">→</div>
            </div>
            <div class="pp-step">
                <div class="pp-num">04</div>
                <div class="pp-body"><h4>Outcome Verification</h4><p>Quantified results against goals defined in Discovery.</p></div>
                <div class="pp-arrow">→</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- ── CREDENTIALS ────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<div class="creds-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="creds-row">
            <div class="cred-item reveal">
                <div class="cred-num">100<em>%</em></div>
                <div class="cred-label">.NET / C# stack alignment. No context switching.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="cred-item reveal reveal-d1">
                <div class="cred-num">$0<em>/mo</em></div>
                <div class="cred-label">Operating cost architecture. Default alive.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="cred-item reveal reveal-d2">
                <div class="cred-num">&lt;2<em>min</em></div>
                <div class="cred-label">CI/CD pipeline. Git push to live production.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="cred-item reveal reveal-d3">
                <div class="cred-num">C2<em>C</em></div>
                <div class="cred-label">Registered as Gilbert Specialists Tech.</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- ── CONTACT CTA ────────────────────────────────────────── -->
<section class="overview-section">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="ov-grid-2">
            <div class="reveal">
                <h2 class="ov-heading cta-heading">Let's<br />Build<br /><span class="accent-w">Together.</span></h2>
            </div>
            <div class="self-center">
                <p class="ov-text reveal reveal-d1">
                    Available for high-value freelance projects and Corp-to-Corp contracts
                    from USA and European markets. Response within 24 hours.
                </p>
                <div class="ov-cta-row reveal reveal-d2">
                    <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">
                        <span>Start a project</span><span class="arrow-right">→</span>
                    </a>
                    <a href="/work" class="btn-secondary">
                        <span>View our work</span><span class="arrow-right">→</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

@code {
    protected override async Task OnAfterRenderAsync(bool firstRender)
    {
        if (firstRender)
            await JS.InvokeVoidAsync("GSTApp.initReveal");
    }
}
